            "rows": "Lift Height | 6.5 Inches\nTyre Size | Engineered specifically for 37-inch tyres.\nSuspension Tech | Utilises a massive BDS 6.5\" Coilover Conversion Kit. This removes the stiff factory torsion bars completely, replacing them with a modern coil spring setup. It includes a full subframe drop, heavy-duty replacement knuckles, and upgraded upper and lower control arms to keep the geometry flawless at extreme heights.\nShock Configuration | Massive Fox 2.5 Performance Elite Series Coilovers up front, paired with standard Fox 2.5 Elites in the rear. Both feature remote reservoirs and adjustable damping clickers, meaning a truck this huge actually rides smoother and absorbs hits better than it did rolling off the showroom floor.\nExtras | We also include colour-coded Husky Extenda Flares and ORI Metal mud flap brackets with rubber to ensure your vehicle is completely compliant and federally approved.\nWhat's Not Included | Just your wheels and tyres! All you need to do is pick your style. We have already set the specific wheel offsets required to keep the build federally compliant, so there is no need to stress about load ratings or legality.",
